WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:02.601
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.601 --> 00:00:03.968
We hope you're
doing well tonight.

00:00:03.968 --> 00:00:05.267
And if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.267 --> 00:00:07.767
Former president Trump
pleaded not guilty yesterday

00:00:07.767 --> 00:00:11.234
to 34 charges of
falsifying business records.

00:00:11.234 --> 00:00:13.300
Well, his voice pleaded
not guilty.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:15.868
His face pleaded
guilty as hell.

00:00:15.868 --> 00:00:17.734
[ Laughter ]

00:00:17.734 --> 00:00:19.634
Former president Trump
spoke last night

00:00:19.634 --> 00:00:21.567
at Mar-a-Lago
following his arraignment

00:00:21.567 --> 00:00:24.234
and said, "I never
thought anything like this

00:00:24.234 --> 00:00:26.801
could happen in America."
Honestly, neither did I.

00:00:26.801 --> 00:00:30.901
I mean, you got away with
so many crimes for so long.

00:00:30.901 --> 00:00:33.000
Trump getting arrested
was like "Avatar 2."

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.934
I just figured it was
never going to happen.

00:00:35.934 --> 00:00:37.367
Then it finally did,
and I was like,

00:00:37.367 --> 00:00:38.901
you know what? Worth the wait.

00:00:38.901 --> 00:00:40.033
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.033 --> 00:00:41.367
In his speech at Mar-a-Lago

00:00:41.367 --> 00:00:42.701
last night
after his arraignment,

00:00:42.701 --> 00:00:44.567
former president Trump
thanked his family

00:00:44.567 --> 00:00:46.567
and said,
"I have a great family

00:00:46.567 --> 00:00:50.167
and they've done a fantastic job
and we appreciate it very much."

00:00:50.167 --> 00:00:53.501
Great that he likes his family.
But why does he talk about them

00:00:53.501 --> 00:00:57.267
the way a high school principal
talks about the prom committee?

00:00:57.267 --> 00:00:59.400
They've done a great job.
We really appreciate them.

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:02.934
And, you know, it looks like
we're under the sea.

00:01:02.934 --> 00:01:04.667
Give them a hand.

00:01:04.667 --> 00:01:07.400
Eric Trump retweeted a photo
of former president Trump

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.701
in court yesterday
with the caption, "Boss!"

00:01:09.701 --> 00:01:11.534
No, dude, it's your father.
What?

00:01:11.534 --> 00:01:13.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.067 --> 00:01:16.400
What is wrong
with this family?

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:18.601
After former president Trump's
post-arraignment event

00:01:18.601 --> 00:01:20.067
at Mar-a-Lago last night,

00:01:20.067 --> 00:01:23.367
Georgia Congresswoman
Marjorie Taylor Greene said that

00:01:23.367 --> 00:01:26.167
Trump was "committed like
she's never seen him before."

00:01:26.167 --> 00:01:29.033
Well, yeah, but that's
a pretty low benchmark.

00:01:29.033 --> 00:01:30.534
If he was committed before,

00:01:30.534 --> 00:01:32.467
he wouldn't be in this mess
to begin with.

00:01:32.467 --> 00:01:34.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:36.400
Fox News chairman
Rupert Murdoch has reportedly

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:37.901
called off his engagement.

00:01:37.901 --> 00:01:41.367
And just as his leg was healing
from getting down on one knee.

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:45.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.067 --> 00:01:47.801
That's right. 92-year-old
Fox News chairman

00:01:47.801 --> 00:01:50.200
Rupert Murdoch has reportedly
called off his engagement.

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:52.734
Yeah, don't rush into anything.

00:01:52.734 --> 00:01:54.634
You've got your whole month
ahead of you.

00:01:54.634 --> 00:01:57.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:59.968
Lawmakers in Texas
are considering two new bills

00:01:59.968 --> 00:02:02.734
that would allow firearm safety
to be taught in high school

00:02:02.734 --> 00:02:05.334
and, if there's money
left over, math.

00:02:05.334 --> 00:02:07.300
[ Laughter ]

